+# Flashloan Arbitrage Bot
+
+This experimental project implements an arbitrage bot that leverages Aave flash loans and multiple DEX integrations.
+
+## Setup
+
+1. Install the base dependencies.
+
+```bash
+npm ci
+```
+
+If any modules are missing after installation, run the recovery script:
+
+```bash
+./scripts/install-deps.sh
+```
+
+2. Start the bot.
+
+```bash
+npm run bot
+```
+
+## Testing
+
+Running the Hardhat test suite requires downloading Solidity compiler binaries. When behind an HTTP proxy, ensure `HTTP_PROXY` and `HTTPS_PROXY` allow connections to `binaries.soliditylang.org`.
+
+```bash
+npm test
+```
+
